  safe: "Eat only the sweet almonds sold as snacks.",
  fact: "All wild almonds used to be bitter. Long ago, people found trees with sweet almonds and kept planting them. In 2019, scientists found that one small change in one gene made almonds sweet.",
  named: "\"Almond\" comes from the Greek word <i>amygdala</i>. The poison amygdalin is named after it too.",
  found: "The Mediterranean and the Middle East. California grows most of the world's sweet almonds.",
